  "gaps": [
    "Catalog year/term is not stated on the page (only tuition for Fall '26 - Summer '27 is printed).",
    "CMIT 130 appears both as a required Professional Course and as a Technology Literacy general-education option; the capture does not say whether one course may satisfy both or whether another Technology Literacy course is then required.",
    "Residency requirement is only implied by 'CCO accepts up to 90 transfer credits toward a bachelor's degree'; no specific courses are stated as required to be completed at Champlain.",
    "Minimum GPA or grade requirements for graduation are not stated.",
    "WEBD 310 lists prerequisite 'WEBD-125 or CMIT-200'; WEBD-125 is not part of the printed requirements (CMIT 200 is required, so it may satisfy the prerequisite).",
    "Arts/Humanities/Social Services option list includes courses (e.g., COMM 130, COMM 140, PHIL 240, CRIT 220, MKCM 120) that also appear in other gen-ed categories; the capture does not state whether a course may count in more than one category."
  ],
